# Target integration contract, not an ESP-IDF project.
# nRF52840 target: use Nordic SDK or Zephyr with APPROTECT enabled for production.
# UART: BG95 at 115200 baud through a bidirectional 1.8V level translator.
# I2C: 400 kHz with bus recovery and TCA9548A channel isolation.
# Storage: append-before-transmit; retain acknowledged records until maintenance erase.
# Security: certificate pinning/validation, signed provisioning, sequence+CRC receipt checks.
